# 🔮 Future Improvements

Potential future versions could include:

* OCR support for scanned/image-only PDFs
* Hybrid keyword + semantic retrieval
* Configurable/weighted scoring rubric (beyond a simple average)
* Persisted action-plan tracking across sessions
* Multi-tender comparison
* Tender deadline tracking
* Company document libraries
* Historical bid analysis
* Bid/no-bid analytics
* User authentication
* Persistent vector databases
* Enterprise document security
* Human-in-the-loop approval workflows

