# 👥 Project

## BidReady AI

### **Know Before You Bid.**

An AI-powered RAG application for **tender intelligence, requirement analysis, company-to-tender matching, and bid-readiness assessment**.

---

## 📜 Disclaimer

BidReady AI provides AI-assisted analysis for informational and decision-support purposes only.

Users remain responsible for independently verifying tender requirements, eligibility conditions, documentation, deadlines, and other obligations against the official tender documents.

**BidReady AI does not provide legal, financial, procurement, or official tender eligibility advice.**
